+## Authorization and omp execution
+
+Research and discussion are read-only. Keep design decisions in the conversation unless a document is explicitly requested. Local implementation approval does not authorize commits or remote actions: obtain explicit approval for commits, pushes, publication, deployment, merges, external messages, and remote resource changes.
